==============================================================
 RESTAURANT RUSH - Stage 3
==============================================================
 You are the manager. 18 turns, 2 tables, 1 Waiter, 1 Host, 1 Chef, 1 Cashier.
 Customers arrive on turns 1, 4, 7, 10, 13 and 16 (turn 4 is a VIP, turn 10 a Critic).
 Menu: Salad $9.00 (1 unit), Burger $15.00 (1 unit), Pasta $18.00 (2 units),
       Salad + Pasta Combo $24.30 (3 units). Happy Hour can be switched on once per game.
 Win: at least 4 paid customers, revenue at least $45.00, average satisfaction at least 60.

